        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>教育活动安排</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    color: #000;\n    font-family: SimSun, \"Songti SC\", \"STSong\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding-left: 48px;\n    padding-right: 32px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 18px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .line {\n    height: 18px;\n    line-height: 18px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .bold {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .top-continuation {\n    margin-left: 62px;\n  }\n\n  .label {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 75px;\n  }\n\n  .child-label {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 54px;\n    margin-left: 19px;\n  }\n\n  .indent-75 {\n    padding-left: 75px;\n  }\n\n  .indent-72 {\n    padding-left: 72px;\n  }\n\n  .indent-55 {\n    padding-left: 55px;\n  }\n\n  .indent-39 {\n    padding-left: 39px;\n  }\n\n  .indent-29 {\n    padding-left: 29px;\n  }\n\n  .blank {\n    height: 16px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"line top-continuation\">学工作。</div>\n  <div class=\"line bold\">教育活动 小班9:10－9:50 中大班9:10－10:00</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"label\">主班教师：</span>1.按教学进度有计划地组织教学活动。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">2.活动过程符合《纲要》《指南》精神，注重激发幼儿自</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">主学习、主动学习、结构完整、重难点突出、自然流</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">畅、教学方法灵活、突出学科特点。</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">（注：中大班集体教学活动不得超过25分钟，小班一节集体教育活动</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">不超过15分钟，其余为游戏活动）。</div>\n  <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"label\">保育员：</span>1.走动、说话声音要轻,不影响幼儿和教师活动。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">2.协助教师对个别需要帮助的幼儿进行适度指导。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">3.活动结束后帮助教师收拾、整理教具。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line bold\">10:00-10:10喝水 如厕</div>\n  <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"child-label\">幼儿：</span>1.根据需要如厕，有序洗手，用自己的水杯按量喝水，不</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">玩水、不洒水。</div>\n  <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"label\">主班教师：</span>1.组织幼儿有序如厕、洗手、喝水。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">2.上、下午各组织三次集体喝水,并提醒幼儿随渴随喝。</div>\n  <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"label\">保育员：</span>1.组织幼儿有序如厕、洗手、喝水。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">2.保证班上有充足的温开水，上、下午各组织三次集体喝</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">水,并提醒幼儿随渴随喝。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-75\">3.保持桌面、地面干燥洁净。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"blank\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"line bold\">10:10-10:40课间操及户外活动</div>\n  <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"child-label\">幼儿：</span>1.整理服装、系好鞋带，愉快地参加体育活动。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-39\">2.有秩序地上下楼，不推挤、不打闹，</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-39\">3.做操队列整齐、精神饱满、有节奏、有力度。（中大班幼</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-72\">儿会领操）</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-39\">4.熟悉并探究各种各类体育器械的玩法，动作灵活、协调。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-39\">5.遵守游戏规则，有自我保护意识,不追逐打闹、不做危险动</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-72\">作。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-39\">6.根据需要喝水、如厕、整理衣服。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-72\">7.能在较冷、较热户外环境中坚持活动。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"label\">主班老师：</span>1.集中整队，清点人数，检查服装、鞋子并进行安全与规</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-55\">则教育。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-55\">2.镜面领操，动作准确到位，观察幼儿做操动作并随机指</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-29\">导。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-55\">4.在自己的视线范围内组织各类活动，集体活动与自由活动</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-55\">相结合，确保每日1小时的体育活动。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-55\">5.能根据幼儿脸色、出汗等情况及时调节活动内容和运动</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-55\">量。</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-55\">6.根据天气变化、运动情况和个体需要，及时提醒幼儿增减</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent-55\">衣服、饮水、擦汗。</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
